  "metadata": {
    "title": "Hive Monitoring (Apis mellifera and Stingless Bees) and Rainfall Data - Federal University of Ceará (UFC) Apiary - Brazil",
    "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.20399470",
    "publication_date": "2026-05-26",
    "description": "<p><strong>General Description</strong> This dataset contains environmental and biometric monitoring records of beehives maintained at the Federal University of Cear&aacute; (UFC) apiary. The objective of this data collection is to evaluate the internal conditions (temperature, humidity, and weight) of two categories of bees: <em>Apis mellifera</em> (Africanized honeybees) and Meliponini (stingless bees).</p>\n<p>To complement the study on the climatic influence on hive development, the repository also includes regional rainfall (precipitation) data collected across different timeframes.</p>\n<p><strong>Dataset Content</strong> The dataset consists of 5 CSV files, categorized into internal hive monitoring and external rainfall data:</p>\n<p><strong>1. Stingless Bees (Meliponini) Monitoring</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong><code>DadosMeliponas.csv</code></strong>: Temperature, humidity, and weight data from stingless bee hives collected between <strong>September 2025 and March 2026</strong> (34,881 records).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>2. <em>Apis mellifera</em> Monitoring</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong><code>dadosColmeia1Apis.csv</code></strong>: Biometric and climatic data from hive 1. Data collected between <strong>February and March 2025</strong> (3,116 records).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong><code>dadosColmeia2Apis.csv</code></strong>: Biometric and climatic data from hive 2. Data collected between <strong>December 2024 and February 2025</strong> (7,066 records).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>3. Rainfall (Precipitation) Data</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong><code>Dados Pluviom&eacute;tricos (jan25-mai25).csv</code></strong>: Rainfall records from the study's coverage area, spanning from <strong>January to May 2025</strong> (151 records).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong><code>Dados Pluviom&eacute;tricos Set25-Mar26.csv</code></strong>: Rainfall records from the coverage area, spanning from <strong>September 2025 to April 2026</strong> (232 records).</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Data Dictionary (Variables)</strong></p>\n<p>For the <strong>Hive files (<code>DadosMeliponas</code>, <code>dadosColmeia1Apis</code>, <code>dadosColmeia2Apis</code>)</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>time</code>: Date and time of data collection (Timestamp).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>id</code>: Unique identifier of the record in the database.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>id_sensor</code>: Numeric identifier of the sensor or monitored hive.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>temperature</code>: Internal hive temperature (&deg;C).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>humidity</code>: Internal hive relative humidity (%).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>weight</code>: Current measured hive weight (kg).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>ext_temperature</code>: External ambient temperature (&deg;C).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>ext_humidity</code>: External ambient relative humidity (%).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>voltage</code>: Sensor system/battery operating voltage (Volts) - <em>Present only in the Stingless Bees (Meliponas) data</em>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>For the <strong>Rainfall files</strong>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><code>id</code>: Unique identifier of the record in the station's system.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>valor</code>: Recorded rainfall volume (millimeters - mm).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>data</code>: Date of measurement (YYYY-MM-DD).</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><code>posto</code>: Collection station identifier.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
